      "review_description": "Fedya was quick to visit when quoting our system, the quote was prompt and included great information on solar iradiation in our exact location so I knew what to expect before the system was installed. We then approved the quote and the install was done within 2 weeks, this included all hardware and access equipment supplied as part of the install.Fedya being both the system designer and installer made the process very smooth compared to other experiences I have had with solar panels being installed. He has a great knowledge of the product and we have been able to link the inverter in with my factory systems to automate my usage to reduce my bills as much as is possible.Very impressive with good communication over the course of the install and then working with the power company to get us connected as quickly as possible, and communicating with me during this process to ensure I knew what to expect.Electrical inspection was done promptly without any need for changes due to the quality of the install, we have also had no issues since the install with the functionality of the system.",
